        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Watch out for these",
      "lines": [
        {
          "say": "The centre angle is the big one. Do not double the wrong way."
        },
        {
          "say": "Check both angles stand on the same arc."
        },
        {
          "say": "Only opposite angles of a cyclic quadrilateral add to 180."
        },
        {
          "say": "Halve the chord before you use Pythagoras.",
          "write": "halve the chord"
        },
        {
          "say": "Mark every radius equal. Look for isosceles triangles."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Remember",
      "lines": [
